  "invariants": [
    "Legacy ForgeCompat workflows keep the single-Spec authority contract.",
    "ForgeNeoBridgeKSampler with compatibility ON builds its run Spec from current widgets and connected loader/LoRA chains. OFF calls core CLIPTextEncode/CLIPSetLastLayer/KSampler directly with current objects and widgets.",
    "Tensors, mutable generators, model references and callable objects never enter JSON Spec.",
    "All bundles must match the Spec config_hash and live model/asset/shape binding.",
    "No automatic prompt LoRA loading inside sampler.",
    "No implicit native sampler fallback."
  ]
